/*
  NotificationChannelsView.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0188 · NotificationChannelsView (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table
  "NotificationChannelsView"). Every key the native surface resolves lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  The first groups are the EXACT keys extracted from the web source
  (web/src/features/notifications/components/NotificationChannelsView.tsx). The web
  hardcodes the channel/field labels in `CHANNEL_TYPES`; the native HIG contract requires
  every visible string to resolve through the facade, so each label is given a stable key
  with the web English as its fallback. The remaining keys back the native chrome (toast,
  freshness chip, banners, and the load/empty/error states the P4 state list requires).
*/

